      "id": 95775,
      "name": "Edwin",
      "username": "Edwin",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-15T16:02:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's nice, certainly, but it doesn't abuse the play-outside-your-turn aspect nearly as much as Unity's Bots or various \"do something awesome and immediately end your turn\" cards (NM's Mist-Fueled Recovery, Scholar's Know When to Hold Fast, and Fanatic's Prayer of Desperation come to mind).&nbsp; Also you can do this with just two heroes, Legacy and the Argent Adept - Vernal Sonata to bring back Take Down for up to four turns running, and two different songs for playing it out of turn.</p>",
